'''Ren Katagiri''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was updated to [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]] and is exclusive to the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event]]. She is acquired as a drop after beating the [[Power Pro Baseball Collaboration Event#Date Chance: Ren|Date Chance: Ren Stages]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 388
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Ren Katagiri
|name2 = Ren Katagiri CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ren Katagiri CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Ren's attack power is too low to act as a reliable zombie killer, relegating her to a narrow niche of zombie knockbacker- a niche already filled by [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Welterweight Cat]]. However, she is not useless, as this effect can be used to greatly help against zombie bosses like [[Miss Haka]] and [[Big Sal]] to prevent them from annihilating your base. When used as support for strong zombie killers like the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|IRON LEGION]] ubers, Ren's little niche can greatly help against hard zombie bosses. Unfortunately, because of her low range and attack power, she will not be used outside of her niche.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

